
## GET ALL PAYMENTS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/payment/get-all
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



## USING QUERY PARAMS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/payment/get-all?reservationId=1&status=Paid&startDate=2026-06-01&endDate=2026-06-30&receivedById=user123&dueToday=false&pageIndex=1&pageSize=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



